    basic: 'Mark penalty tiles (3-suit and double-0) so they are easy to spot; the game feels different from Hearts—moon shots are more frequent due to smaller deck and every tile belonging to two suits. Follow suit when possible; avoid taking tricks with penalty tiles.',
