    advanced: 'When passing: passing high/doubles and penalty tiles to your left helps their moon-shot; holding doubles and penalty tiles can be the best defence. Defending against moon-shots is hard—penalty tiles can fall to other suits. Balance dumping points vs blocking the shooter.',
